        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a land turned to ash, every bullet counts. The Last Zone blends fast-paced third-person combat with strategic base defense. Choose your weapons, lay traps, reinforce barricades, and plan against relentless waves of varied enemies. The wave system applies different pressure every run; you’ll answer with a new solution each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/802e111bd907fb64dfacd70fd68b82f7.poster.avif?t=1762526937\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/802e111bd907fb64dfacd70fd68b82f7.webm?t=1762526937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/802e111bd907fb64dfacd70fd68b82f7.mp4?t=1762526937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources and complete side objectives to strengthen your arsenal, trigger special abilities at the right moment, and dismantle threats from shambling zombies to towering bosses. With Endless Mode, jump back in again and again—each attempt demands a fresh plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast firefights + smart defense:</strong> Marries third-person shooter action with trap/barricade placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving enemy waves:</strong> Each wave hits harder; new types and behaviors force new tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/60ec364a9aa21aba722723453b94a077.poster.avif?t=1762526937\" width=960 height=48