ectives:</strong> Scavenge the zone, complete tasks, and boost your offense and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss encounters:</strong> Face tough enemies with distinct weak points and patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/b14ba32b5ecee1c1db7704154618c8bb.poster.avif?t=1762526937\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/b14ba32b5ecee1c1db7704154618c8bb.webm?t=1762526937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/b14ba32b5ecee1c1db7704154618c8bb.mp4?t=1762526937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless replayability:</strong> Dynamic waves and upgrades keep every run fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you outlast the apocalypse and become the zone’s legendary defender?</strong></p>",
